    }
}
```

**Advantages:**
✅ More powerful than basic locators
✅ Faster than XPath
✅ Can handle complex scenarios
✅ Widely supported
✅ Familiar to web developers

**When to Use:**
- Basic locators don't work
- Need to combine multiple conditions
- Need to find element by attribute
- Working with complex HTML structure

